  "tutorial_finish": "Start",
  "tutorial_step_map": "This map is Africa’s real satellite picture. In the middle is your country, America (blue): Washington, New York, Chicago and Los Angeles. Every country around it is a bot! The number above each city shows its soldiers. Cities nobody owns hold 50 to 70 soldiers; there is no empty land, you must take every place with soldiers. Pinch with two fingers to zoom and drag to move.",
  "tutorial_step_territory": "Select one of your cities, then tap a neighbouring city to attack or move soldiers. If your attackers outnumber its soldiers, the city is yours. Tap your selected city again to deploy reserve soldiers.",
  "tutorial_step_resources": "At the end of each turn you earn 80 diamonds, 10 soldiers and 3 more soldiers for every city you own. Capture a diamond mine for 250 more diamonds, or a gold mine (the gold crown) for 150.",
  "tutorial_step_abilities": "Cards are kept in your hand with a count; using one uses it up. Bombs kill soldiers but do not take the city — attack it afterwards. Fire Bomb kills 30 in 1 city, Bombardment 40 in 2, Super Blast 60 in 3. Atom Bomb kills 80 in 4 cities and Nuclear Bomb 100 in 6, anywhere on the map. Tribute takes 200 diamonds from a player. Soldier Spell brings 30 soldiers. Every turn Draw Card gives you a free card; the arrow opens and closes the card panel.",
  "tutorial_step_shop": "Buy cards with your diamonds in the Weapon Shop; each one is added to your hand.",
  "tutorial_step_end_turn": "When you are ready, press End Turn; the bots play next.",
  "tutorial_step_victory": "Wipe every bot off the map, or conquer all of Africa, to win.",
